.TH bap-report 1  "bap-report " 
.SH NAME
bap\-report \- Print measured reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-report\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print measured reports
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
